---
description: Team Python coding standards
globs: ["**/*.py"]
alwaysApply: true
---
- Python 3.11+. Follow PEP 8; Ruff is the linter and formatter.
- Type hints on all public functions; code must pass mypy.
- Tests use pytest in tests/, mirroring the package layout.
- No secrets in code. Read config from environment variables.
- Validate inputs at boundaries (e.g. Pydantic). Raise specific exceptions, never bare except.
- Dependencies are pinned in pyproject.toml.
- Every bug fix includes a regression test.
